        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Sadler, Pete Hewitt, Bruce Willis, Lewis Burwell \"Chesty\" Puller\n- Films: Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey, Die Hard 2, The Shawshank Redemption, Hard To Kill\n- Television Series: The Pacific, Roswell\n- Roles: Grim Reaper, Colonel Stuart, Heywood, Sheriff Jim Valenti, Senator Vernon Trent\n- Awards: Saturn Award for Best Supporting Actor\n\nFacts:\n- Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey is a 1991 American science fiction comedy film.\n- Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey was the directing debut of Pete Hewitt.\n- William Sadler played the Grim Reaper in Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey and won the Saturn Award for Best Supporting Actor for that role.\n- William Sadler played Colonel Stuart opposite Bruce Willis in Die Hard 2.\n- William Sadler played convict Heywood in The Shawshank Redemption.\n- William Sadler played Senator Vernon Trent in Hard To Kill.\n- William Sadler played Sheriff Jim Valenti in Roswell.\n- William Sadler played Lewis Burwell \"Chesty\" Puller in The Pacific.",
